<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina placed $5.66 bln in reverse repos.</title>
<headline>Argentina placed $5.66 bln in reverse repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Monday it placed $5.66 billion in overnight reverse repurchase agreements January 10.</p>
<p>The reverse repos were placed at 4.75 percent against government bonds.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
